        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.767,
            0.848,
            0.86
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "You might know the size of the world’s human population. Have you ever wondered how many ants there might be in the world or how long ago humans emerged? In this section, we shall explore numbers significantly larger than arabs and billions. We shall use powers of 10 to represent and compare these numbers in each case."
            }
          ]
        },
