              "styles": [
                "superscript"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " As of mid-2025, there are only two northern white rhinos remaining in the world, both females, and they reside at the Ol Pejeta Conservancy in Kenya (= 2 × 10"
